Package: easypatch-agent
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @DEBARCH@
Maintainer: DHI Technical Services LLC <paulmataruso@dhitechnical.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.27), libgcc-s1 | libgcc1, libstdc++6, libssl3t64 | libssl3 | libssl1.1, ca-certificates, systemd
Description: EasyPatch patch management agent
 Reports missing package updates to an EasyPatch server and installs the
 updates an administrator approves, with apt. Runs as the easypatch-agent
 systemd service. Enroll with "easypatch-agent enroll" or the install script
 from the EasyPatch console.
